# Project

Canonical instructions: `AGENTS.md`. Stack: Next.js 16.3 (App Router, Turbopack) + React 19.3 + TypeScript + Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui (base-nova). Use **pnpm** for everything.

- Read the relevant guide in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before touching routing, data fetching, caching or server/client boundaries.
- Project skills live in `.agents/skills/` — see `docs/agent-skills.md`.
- Before git stash/pull/merge/rebase, check branch state and warn about consequences.
- Keep changes small; no large refactors or marketing copy unless asked.
